OL,3,GNEWSAHigh Court quashes decision to
OL,4,Arestrict annual Drumcree parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe High Court has quashed a Parades
OL,7,FCommission decision to impose
OL,8,Frestrictions on one of the most
OL,9,Fcontentious parades in Northern
OL,10,FIreland.
OL,12,FIt follows a legal challenge brought by
OL,13,Fa member of the Orange Order over its
OL,14,Fannual parade at Drumcree outside
OL,15,FPortadown.
OL,17,FThe commission had banned this year's
OL,18,Fparade from entering the mainly
OL,19,Fnationalist Garvaghy Road - a move
OL,20,Fwhich reflected every decision it has
OL,21,Fmade since 1998.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
