OL,3,GNEWSAHigh Court quashes decision to
OL,4,Arestrict annual Drumcree parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has been claimed the case may pave
OL,7,Fthe way for a future parade on the road
OL,8,Fbeing permitted. However, it would
OL,9,Frequire a new decision based on a fresh
OL,10,Fapplication.
